<section id="about" class="section about chapter" data-octree-state="about">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="head-meta" data-reveal>
      <p class="mono-label"><span class="lvl">L3</span> · About</p>
      <p class="mono-label">Auckland, NZ · <span class="hatch">////////</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="chapter-count" data-reveal style="--i: 1" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="n">05</span><span class="d">/ 06</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="about-body">
    <h2 class="about-title" data-reveal>About</h2>
    <div class="about-text" data-reveal style="--i: 1">
      <p>
        I’m a systems-oriented engineer in Auckland — four years across gameplay, systems and
        engine-adjacent code, strongest in C++ and C#. The part I like is the layer underneath: why
        a structure is shaped the way it is, what it costs, and where it could be better.
      </p>
      <p>
        I studied software engineering at Media Design School (B.S.E, 2023–2025), mentored there in
        2025 and at NZGDC 2024, and keep showing up to Global Game Jam. Away from a compiler I’m
        learning Mandarin. New Zealand citizen, based in Auckland.
      </p>
      <p>
        Right now I’m looking for engineering roles — Auckland or remote — where the interesting
        problems are under the hood.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-tech" data-reveal style="--i: 2">
      <p class="mono-label tech-title">Tech</p>
      <ul class="cell-grid cols-3">
        {tech.map((t) => <li class="cell">{t}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

